From: Singupalli Kartik <skartik1706@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:12:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add `wallet disclose`: ZIP 311 payment disclosures for
 Ironwood spends
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Creates a zpd1… string proving this wallet controlled the spend authority of a sent
transaction (fresh Orchard action proof at the tx's anchor + signature), revealing only
the chosen outputs. Uses the zip311 crate.
